faq:
  - q: How does HelioLattice stop two people calling the same customer?
    a: Phone numbers are normalised and matched when an enquiry is created or imported. Existing matches are shown, and an override needs permission and a recorded reason.
  - q: What happens to leads when a salesperson leaves?
    a: The enquiries and their full call and activity history stay with the company and can be reassigned, individually or in bulk.
  - q: Can we import leads from an event or a campaign?
    a: Yes. Import a sheet, review each row in a preview, and save it as a list tagged by source.
